export function newProfile(name,avatar=AVATARS[0],color=COLORS[0]){return{id:newid(),name:name.trim().slice(0,24),avatar,color,background:'orbit',cosmetic:'none',theme:'neon',createdAt:Date.now(),xp:0,points:0,played:0,won:0,lost:0,draws:0,streak:0,longestStreak:0,h2hWins:0,achievements:[],artCount:0,results:[]};}
